This software is developed strictly as a research and educational prototype
for multimodal post-operative rehabilitation monitoring. It is NOT an FDA-approved
or CE-marked medical device and does NOT provide medical diagnosis, treatment
recommendations, or definitive clinical assessments. 

All clinical recommendations, rehabilitation exercise prescriptions, and recovery
milestones must be supervised and approved by a certified orthopedic surgeon,
physiotherapist, or occupational therapist.
